  "sourceFetchedAt": "2026-10-28T00:52:55.645133+00:00",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-01-08T22:08:25-05:00\" title=\"Monday, January 8, 2018, 10:08 pm\">January 8, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t<h3 class=\"font-headlines\">For Art and The Community</h3>\n<figure id=\"attachment_3161\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img class=\"size-full wp-image-3161\" src=\"/media/archive/672ddb3d891d24bf05d08b542a3d28753e36a07053fc97e087303433658aef08.jpg\" alt=\"Larry Folding at Bountiful Boarders, West Harwich. ©Kathleen Magnusson\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3161\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Larry Folding at Bountiful Boarders, West Harwich. ©Kathleen Magnusson</figcaption></figure>\n<p><a href=\"/media/archive/61dc890eb608808b81d7fc55ad4a4b1fb833d566e64b969ed69cb823011519b9.pdf\">D</a><a title=\"Original source download unavailable\" href>ownload the 2022 Membership Application and become a member today!</a><span data-fidelity-note=\"missing-download\" class=\"asset-gap\"> (source download unavailable)</span></p>\n<p>The Guild of Harwich Artists, Inc. is a non-profit 501(c)3 organization of Harwich residents and taxpayers who share an interest in visual art. Our mission is to encourage artists and those interested in art through education, fellowship, and exhibitions, and to engage in charitable works that benefit Harwich residents.</p>\n<p>Established in 1979, we maintain an active schedule of shows and events, manage our own year-round Harwich Port gallery, <a title=\"Original source page returned 404\" href>The Art Gallery of The Guild of Harwich Artists</a><span data-fidelity-note=\"functional\" class=\"note\"> (source page unavailable)</span>, and share our talents working with public school students. We get together in warm weather for <a href=\"/news/plein-air-painting-event-at-the-nickerson-family-association/\">painting en plein air</a>, as well as indoor work sessions at The Harwich Community Center the rest of the year. Our <a href=\"/pages/monthly-meetings/\">monthly meetings</a> from September-May feature a well known Cape artist demonstrator. All programs are free and open to the public.</p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2801\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img class=\"wp-image-2801 size-full\" src=\"/media/archive/bdc331410c60fdd1dd12da13a278aec620463263e20ca7b6224053e68c62b84a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"428\" loading=\"lazy\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2801\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Weedie Tyldesley</figcaption></figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_1110\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img class=\"wp-image-1110 size-full\" src=\"/media/archive/a9ca53ed0361416f16f70f6b489280dcc71ed43836a2a8db1e6d9702c63fba1d.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"618\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-1110\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">John Glass</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-terms category\">Posted in <a href=\"/archive/source-e23b79be08a822c7b682/\" rel=\"tag\">WHAT'S NEW</a></span>\t\t\t<br /><span class=\"entry-terms post_tag\">Tagged <a href=\"/archive/source-4d8a37313a19a46a9741/\" rel=\"tag\">Cape Cod Art Galleries</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-c5a0664c0f5b2d29d271/\" rel=\"tag\">Guild of Harwich Artists</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-6f56c969f1b38f37fb88/\" rel=\"tag\">Harwich MA</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-b9ab081a4bc798f19819/\" rel=\"tag\">The Art Gallery of The Guild of Harwich Artists</a></span>\t\t</footer>\n\n\t\n",
